          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131862,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é verdadeiro em relação ao bloco <code>continue</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A instrução <code>continue</code> pula o restante do bloco do loop atual</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A instrução <code>continue</code> interrompe o loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A declaração <code>continue</code> é executada após o loop terminar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A instrução <code>continue</code> pula o restante do bloco do loop atual.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O bloco de um loop exibe <code>Start</code>, chega a <code>continue</code> e depois tem uma linha para exibir <code>End</code>.</p><p>O que é exibido nessa passagem?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Somente <code>Start</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Somente <code>End</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Start</code> e <code>End</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Somente <code>Start</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 131863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que o loop pare quando <code>count</code> atingir <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Faça o loop exibir apenas <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> e <code>2</code> e depois encerre-o por completo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>==</code> seguido de <code>3</code> e finalmente <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
