          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 131864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é verdadeiro em relação à declaração <code>break</code> dentro de um loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A declaração <code>break</code> para o loop completamente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A declaração <code>break</code> pula a iteração atual</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A declaração <code>break</code> é executada após o loop terminar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A declaração <code>break</code> para o loop completamente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um loop <code>for</code> usa <code>break</code> ao encontrar uma correspondência antes do último item. Você troca por <code>continue</code>.</p><p>O que muda?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele verifica o próximo item em vez de encerrar a busca.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele ainda encerra a busca na correspondência.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele reinicia a busca no primeiro item.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele verifica o próximo item em vez de encerrar a busca.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131865,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que <code>\"Loop finished!\"</code> será impresso quando o loop terminar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o loop para exibir de <code>0</code> a <code>4</code>, seguido de <code>Loop finished!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>5</code> seguido de <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
